From: folia-linear-ci <folia-linear-ci@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 19:47:42 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Linear zstd workers + LDM + reader long-max (minecraft-0018)

Loop-3 (agent 26): writer setWorkers(n)/setLong(w) + reader
setLongMax(27). Reader ships WITH writer (reader-first for any future
windowLog>27). BOTH default 0 = inert (serial, LDM off). Verified numbers
from Loop-1 agent 10 (10-zstd-upstream.md): JNI caps setLong at windowLog
27, decoder default accepts 27, MT@22 zero speedup + ~690MB native,
LDM@L1 cheap. Setters before first write (IllegalStateException after).
Native-memory caution in code + docs.

